        "content": "<p>adamrk <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14112#issuecomment-5269871439\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/14112\">issue #14112</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I can take a look at handling this.</p>\n</blockquote>",
